    "detailed_description": "A fun game involving colors and your memory.<br />\r\nIn Color Guardian, you must memorize a sequence of colors that will be shown and make the highest score possible.<br />\r\nYou can challenge some family / friend to compete with you, and see who can get the highest score.<br />\r\nThe challenge is not so great at the beginning of the game, but I doubt that you will be able to go from level 20 upwards.<br />\r\nHow about a little brain training with a fun memory and color challenge?<br />\r\nDecorate, hit and win!",
